1
00:00:00,351 --> 00:00:02,991
(Leonard:)and see the look
on Sheldon's stupid face

2
00:00:03,154 --> 00:00:06,264
(Leonard:)when he sees that I didn't
let this get to me.

3
00:00:08,092 --> 00:00:10,092
(Penny:)Sheldon's not here.
Why don't you take the sweater off?

4
00:00:10,261 --> 00:00:12,671
-There's a principle at stake!
-Which is?

5
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:15,370
(Lucy:)Oh, I don't know.
Who cares? Look at me!

6
00:00:16,801 --> 00:00:18,781
(Penny:)Oh, my God!
Is that sweater made of bees?

7
00:00:20,104 --> 00:00:21,944
(Penny:)Come on, take it off. I won't tell.

8
00:00:22,106 --> 00:00:24,176
(Leonard:)No, no, honey, if I take it off,
Sheldon wins.

9
00:00:24,342 --> 00:00:29,152
(Penny:)Sweetie, every night you don't
kill him in his sleep, he wins.

10
00:00:30,548 --> 00:00:32,498
No, it's almost done.

11
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:36,190
(Leonard:)I just... I have to find
the next of kin, and send 'em the DVD

12
00:00:36,354 --> 00:00:38,464
(Leonard:)and then just wait for someone
with my complexion to die

13
00:00:38,623 --> 00:00:40,363
(Leonard:)so I can get a skin graft.

14
00:00:41,659 --> 00:00:42,869
(Penny:)Smile.

15
00:00:43,628 --> 00:00:44,838
(Leonard:)What is that? What is that for?

16
00:00:44,996 --> 00:00:47,976
(Penny:)So you can send it to Princeton
and get your money back.

17
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:55,040
(Amy:)I must say, Sheldon,
you're handling this DVD business

18
00:00:55,206 --> 00:00:56,846
(Amy:)with an impressive amount
of maturity.

19
00:00:57,575 --> 00:01:00,645
(Sheldon:)I don't know why that surprises you.
I'm a grown man.

